<http://data.silknow.org/object/f319aacd-a361-3269-b8b2-2367fb30bbca>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "Corinne Thépaut-Cabasset, ‘The miniature suit: Clothing fashion in 18th-century Europe’, http://www.fashioningtheearlymodern.ac.uk/object-in-focus/the-miniature-suit/ [posted April 2013] - an article on this suit\nLesley E. Miller, ‘Les matériaux du costume de cour’. In <i>Fastes de cour et cérémonies royales : Le costume de cour en Europe 1650-1815</i>, exh. cat., Château de Versailles, Paris : RMN, 2009, pp. 78-89. Details the fabrics used for court dress.\nLena Rangström, <i>Lions of Fashion. Male fashion of the 16th, 17th, 18th centuries</i>, Livrustkammaren: Stockholm, 2002, pp. 206 & 233, cat. nos. 237 & 248 for clothing of Gustavus III of Sweden.\nGarsault, <i>L’art du tailleur, contenant le tailleur d’habits d’hommes; les culottes de peau; le tailleur de corps de femmes & enfants; la couturiere; & la marchande de modes</i>, Paris: Académie des Sciences, 1769.\nFlorence Montgomery. <i>Textiles in America 1650-1870</i>. Norton: New York, 1984, pp. 298, 339, 358. For definitions of textile terms."@en ;
        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/7dee430c-e2cc-35c2-886a-06813a97816e> ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/information/bibliography> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Corinne Thépaut-Cabasset, ‘The miniature suit: Clothing fashion in 18th-century Europe’, http://www.fashioningtheearlymodern.ac.uk/object-in-focus/the-miniature-suit/ [posted April 2013] - an article on this suit\nLesley E. Miller, ‘Les matériaux du costume de cour’. In <i>Fastes de cour et cérémonies royales : Le costume de cour en Europe 1650-1815</i>, exh. cat., Château de Versailles, Paris : RMN, 2009, pp. 78-89. Details the fabrics used for court dress.\nLena Rangström, <i>Lions of Fashion. Male fashion of the 16th, 17th, 18th centuries</i>, Livrustkammaren: Stockholm, 2002, pp. 206 & 233, cat. nos. 237 & 248 for clothing of Gustavus III of Sweden.\nGarsault, <i>L’art du tailleur, contenant le tailleur d’habits d’hommes; les culottes de peau; le tailleur de corps de femmes & enfants; la couturiere; & la marchande de modes</i>, Paris: Académie des Sciences, 1769.\nFlorence Montgomery. <i>Textiles in America 1650-1870</i>. Norton: New York, 1984, pp. 298, 339, 358. For definitions of textile terms."@en .

